{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory met the responsibility chain without a serious or minor in-chain gap: the doctor repeatedly kept the family within hospital/neuro-service supervision, prohibited unsafe self-transport or tube/medication handling, clarified levetiracetam/medication handoff, tracked MRI/EEG and swallowing evaluations, and gave actionable red flags. It also completed multiple high-order points by turning caregiver fatigue, cost/bed/transport barriers, and unsafe family impulses into concrete, safe alternatives and teach-back style checklists. The episode ends as a valid open transition after arrival at the receiving hospital, with prior safe instructions still covering the family’s terminal question.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02131",
        "explanation": "The doctor framed transfer as not complete until receiving-side clinical handoff and gave an executable arrival checklist.",
        "quote": "转院完成，要等老人安全到接收病区"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02147",
        "explanation": "The terminal family message shows the patient has reached the receiving ward, but asks a new follow-up question, making the trajectory open rather than closed.",
        "quote": "老人已经到接收医院病区床边了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded transition was actively managed through safe transport planning, receiving-team handoff, medication/tube cautions, and red-flag escalation. The final turn is an unanswered family update after arrival, but the prior plan is sufficiently safe and traceable, so this is a valid open state rather than premature closure.",
    "label": "valid_open",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02131",
        "explanation": "The doctor reduced the final transfer step into a concrete checklist.",
        "quote": "上车前最后只盯 5 件事"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00377",
        "explanation": "The doctor interpreted a nondiagnostic EEG appropriately without falsely excluding epilepsy.",
        "quote": "没抓到放电 ≠ 脑子里不会放电"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00401",
        "explanation": "The doctor distinguished inpatient temporary medication boundaries from the future discharge medication plan.",
        "quote": "住院规则是\"这几天别乱动\""
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00123",
        "explanation": "The doctor identified seizure recurrence, aspiration/respiratory issues, and focal neurologic change as immediate escalation triggers.",
        "quote": "再抽、叫不醒、吐呛、紫、呼吸不对"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
