          "quote": "抽、紫、歪、掉、血、烫、闹"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02020",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly reduced unnecessary messaging and prioritized caregiver sleep.",
          "quote": "睡比发我重要"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was repeatedly triggered by the family’s anxiety and fatigue. The doctor used short scripts, mnemonics, prioritized contact triggers, reassurance, and rest instructions with meaningful impact on execution.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02131",
          "explanation": "The doctor bounded the episode as preparation for transport, not completion of all care.",
          "quote": "准备基本完成 ≠ 已经转院完成"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02131",
          "explanation": "The doctor reiterated the safe residual boundary for family actions during the transition.",
          "quote": "不喂水喂药、不碰管、不自己处理抽搐"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by the need to carry residual risks safely into a receiving service. The doctor summarized must-do transition items and explicitly left ongoing neurologic, swallowing, medication, and receiving-doctor decisions to the relevant teams.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
